title expense-claims-guard

component expense-webapp as "Expense Claims" web-application
component expense-api as "Expense Claims API" service
component receipt-reader as "Receipt Reader" ai-agent
component claims-db as "Claims Database" database
component memory-db as "Receipt Reader Memory" database

east thunder as "Thunder Auth" identity-server

north -> expense-webapp
north -> expense-api
north -> receipt-reader

expense-webapp -> expense-api
expense-webapp -> receipt-reader
expense-webapp -> thunder

expense-api -> thunder
expense-api -> claims-db

receipt-reader -> thunder
receipt-reader -> memory-db
